{
 "voice": "af_bella",
 "speed": 1.0,
 "fps": 30,
 "sample_rate": 24000,
 "gaps": {
  "sentence": 0.35,
  "scene": 0.8,
  "lead": 0.3,
  "tail": 0.3
 },
 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "s01_hook",
   "start": 0.3,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Two arrows in, one number out: the dot product.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 0.3,
     "end": 3.925,
     "dur": 3.625,
     "start_frame": 9,
     "end_frame": 118
    },
    {
     "text": "First, what it is.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 4.275,
     "end": 6.275,
     "dur": 2.0,
     "start_frame": 128,
     "end_frame": 188
    },
    {
     "text": "Then, why it's built this way.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 6.625,
     "end": 9.175,
     "dur": 2.55,
     "start_frame": 199,
     "end_frame": 275
    }
   ],
   "end": 9.975,
   "start_frame": 9,
   "end_frame": 299
  },
  {
   "id": "s02_arrows",
   "start": 9.975,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "An arrow, or vector, has a length and a direction.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 9.975,
     "end": 13.6,
     "dur": 3.625,
     "start_frame": 299,
     "end_frame": 408
    },
    {
     "text": "Arrow a goes five right and one up: five, one.",
     "audio_text": "Arrow [A](/ˈA/) goes five right and one up: five, one.",
     "start": 13.95,
     "end": 17.8,
     "dur": 3.85,
     "start_frame": 418,
     "end_frame": 534
    },
    {
     "text": "Arrow b is one, three; the numbers are components.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 18.15,
     "end": 21.975,
     "dur": 3.825,
     "start_frame": 545,
     "end_frame": 659
    },
    {
     "text": "Pythagoras gives the lengths: about five point one and three point one six.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 22.325,
     "end": 27.625,
     "dur": 5.3,
     "start_frame": 670,
     "end_frame": 829
    }
   ],
   "end": 28.425,
   "start_frame": 299,
   "end_frame": 853
  },
  {
   "id": "s03_def_components",
   "start": 28.425,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Definition one: multiply matching parts, then add.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 28.425,
     "end": 32.575,
     "dur": 4.15,
     "start_frame": 853,
     "end_frame": 977
    },
    {
     "text": "The small number under each letter says which part.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 32.925,
     "end": 36.5,
     "dur": 3.575,
     "start_frame": 988,
     "end_frame": 1095
    },
    {
     "text": "The last form writes i twice: a repeated index means add over i equals one, two and three.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 36.85,
     "end": 43.6,
     "dur": 6.75,
     "start_frame": 1106,
     "end_frame": 1308
    }
   ],
   "end": 44.4,
   "start_frame": 853,
   "end_frame": 1332
  },
  {
   "id": "s04_labels",
   "start": 44.4,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "K two point two is equation two point two of Kundu, Cohen and Dowling's Fluid Mechanics, fifth edition.",
     "audio_text": "K two point two is equation two point two of Koondoo, Cohen and Dowling's Fluid Mechanics, fifth edition.",
     "start": 44.4,
     "end": 51.8,
     "dur": 7.4,
     "start_frame": 1332,
     "end_frame": 1554
    },
    {
     "text": "Labels with 0A, the digit zero, are ours: Chapter Zero, Part A of this course.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 52.15,
     "end": 58.25,
     "dur": 6.1,
     "start_frame": 1565,
     "end_frame": 1748
    },
    {
     "text": "Vallis labels point to the main book, and the footnote gives each page.",
     "audio_text": "Valiss labels point to the main book, and the footnote gives each page.",
     "start": 58.6,
     "end": 63.45,
     "dur": 4.85,
     "start_frame": 1758,
     "end_frame": 1904
    }
   ],
   "end": 64.25,
   "start_frame": 1332,
   "end_frame": 1928
  },
  {
   "id": "s05_example",
   "start": 64.25,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Try it: five times one, plus one times three, is eight.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 64.25,
     "end": 68.5,
     "dur": 4.25,
     "start_frame": 1928,
     "end_frame": 2055
    },
    {
     "text": "The z-parts are zero here.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 68.85,
     "end": 71.05,
     "dur": 2.2,
     "start_frame": 2066,
     "end_frame": 2132
    },
    {
     "text": "Eight is a number, not an arrow.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 71.4,
     "end": 74.0,
     "dur": 2.6,
     "start_frame": 2142,
     "end_frame": 2220
    }
   ],
   "end": 74.8,
   "start_frame": 1928,
   "end_frame": 2244
  },
  {
   "id": "s06_def_cosine",
   "start": 74.8,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Definition two uses theta, the angle between the arrows: both lengths times the cosine of theta.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 74.8,
     "end": 81.875,
     "dur": 7.075,
     "start_frame": 2244,
     "end_frame": 2456
    },
    {
     "text": "Cosine is one for the same direction, zero at a right angle, minus one for opposite.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 82.225,
     "end": 88.525,
     "dur": 6.3,
     "start_frame": 2467,
     "end_frame": 2656
    },
    {
     "text": "Here it's point four nine six: eight again.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 88.875,
     "end": 92.125,
     "dur": 3.25,
     "start_frame": 2666,
     "end_frame": 2764
    }
   ],
   "end": 92.925,
   "start_frame": 2244,
   "end_frame": 2788
  },
  {
   "id": "s07_same_way",
   "start": 92.925,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So the dot product measures how much two arrows point the same way.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 92.925,
     "end": 97.225,
     "dur": 4.3,
     "start_frame": 2788,
     "end_frame": 2917
    },
    {
     "text": "Three, zero with two, zero: six.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 97.575,
     "end": 100.55,
     "dur": 2.975,
     "start_frame": 2927,
     "end_frame": 3016
    },
    {
     "text": "At a right angle, zero; backwards, minus six.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 100.9,
     "end": 104.55,
     "dur": 3.65,
     "start_frame": 3027,
     "end_frame": 3136
    }
   ],
   "end": 105.35,
   "start_frame": 2788,
   "end_frame": 3160
  },
  {
   "id": "s08_shadow",
   "start": 105.35,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Drop a line from the tip of arrow a onto b's line, at a right angle.",
     "audio_text": "Drop a line from the tip of arrow [A](/ˈA/) onto b's line, at a right angle.",
     "start": 105.35,
     "end": 110.375,
     "dur": 5.025,
     "start_frame": 3160,
     "end_frame": 3311
    },
    {
     "text": "The stretch it marks off is the shadow of arrow a on b.",
     "audio_text": "The stretch it marks off is the shadow of arrow [A](/ˈA/) on b.",
     "start": 110.725,
     "end": 114.8,
     "dur": 4.075,
     "start_frame": 3322,
     "end_frame": 3444
    },
    {
     "text": "In this right-angled triangle, arrow a is the long side.",
     "audio_text": "In this right-angled triangle, arrow [A](/ˈA/) is the long side.",
     "start": 115.15,
     "end": 119.575,
     "dur": 4.425,
     "start_frame": 3454,
     "end_frame": 3587
    },
    {
     "text": "The shadow is the side next to theta, so it's the length of arrow a times cos theta.",
     "audio_text": "The shadow is the side next to theta, so it's the length of arrow [A](/ˈA/) times cos theta.",
     "start": 119.925,
     "end": 125.65,
     "dur": 5.725,
     "start_frame": 3598,
     "end_frame": 3769
    },
    {
     "text": "Divide definition two by the length of b: it cancels on the right, leaving the shadow, a dot b over the length of b.",
     "audio_text": "Divide definition two by the length of b: it cancels on the right, leaving the shadow, [A](/ˈA/) dot b over the length of b.",
     "start": 126.0,
     "end": 134.4,
     "dur": 8.4,
     "start_frame": 3780,
     "end_frame": 4032
    },
    {
     "text": "Eight over three point one six two: two point five three.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 134.75,
     "end": 138.875,
     "dur": 4.125,
     "start_frame": 4042,
     "end_frame": 4166
    },
    {
     "text": "And b over its own length, b hat, is b shrunk to length one.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 139.225,
     "end": 143.975,
     "dur": 4.75,
     "start_frame": 4177,
     "end_frame": 4319
    },
    {
     "text": "So the shadow is also a dot b hat.",
     "audio_text": "So the shadow is also [A](/ˈA/) dot b hat.",
     "start": 144.325,
     "end": 147.25,
     "dur": 2.925,
     "start_frame": 4330,
     "end_frame": 4417
    }
   ],
   "end": 148.05,
   "start_frame": 3160,
   "end_frame": 4442
  },
  {
   "id": "s09_question",
   "start": 148.05,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So the dot product is the shadow times the length of b.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 148.05,
     "end": 152.025,
     "dur": 3.975,
     "start_frame": 4441,
     "end_frame": 4561
    },
    {
     "text": "Why not just stop at the shadow?",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 152.375,
     "end": 154.675,
     "dur": 2.3,
     "start_frame": 4571,
     "end_frame": 4640
    }
   ],
   "end": 155.475,
   "start_frame": 4442,
   "end_frame": 4664
  },
  {
   "id": "s10_reason1_order",
   "start": 155.475,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason one: order.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 155.475,
     "end": 157.825,
     "dur": 2.35,
     "start_frame": 4664,
     "end_frame": 4735
    },
    {
     "text": "The shadow of arrow a on b is two point five three.",
     "audio_text": "The shadow of arrow [A](/ˈA/) on b is two point five three.",
     "start": 158.175,
     "end": 162.0,
     "dur": 3.825,
     "start_frame": 4745,
     "end_frame": 4860
    },
    {
     "text": "The shadow of b on arrow a is one point five seven.",
     "audio_text": "The shadow of b on arrow [A](/ˈA/) is one point five seven.",
     "start": 162.35,
     "end": 166.35,
     "dur": 4.0,
     "start_frame": 4870,
     "end_frame": 4990
    },
    {
     "text": "Times the other length, both give eight.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 166.7,
     "end": 169.375,
     "dur": 2.675,
     "start_frame": 5001,
     "end_frame": 5081
    }
   ],
   "end": 170.175,
   "start_frame": 4664,
   "end_frame": 5105
  },
  {
   "id": "s11_reason2_cheap",
   "start": 170.175,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason two: it's cheap: no angle, no square root.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 170.175,
     "end": 174.175,
     "dur": 4.0,
     "start_frame": 5105,
     "end_frame": 5225
    },
    {
     "text": "The shadow comes from it by one division.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 174.525,
     "end": 177.5,
     "dur": 2.975,
     "start_frame": 5236,
     "end_frame": 5325
    },
    {
     "text": "If b has length one, a dot b over one is just a dot b: the dot product is the shadow.",
     "audio_text": "If b has length one, [A](/ˈA/) dot b over one is just [A](/ˈA/) dot b: the dot product is the shadow.",
     "start": 177.85,
     "end": 184.575,
     "dur": 6.725,
     "start_frame": 5335,
     "end_frame": 5537
    },
    {
     "text": "That's how x hat, one unit east, picks out a wind's eastward part.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 184.925,
     "end": 189.9,
     "dur": 4.975,
     "start_frame": 5548,
     "end_frame": 5697
    }
   ],
   "end": 190.7,
   "start_frame": 5105,
   "end_frame": 5721
  },
  {
   "id": "s12_reason3_work",
   "start": 190.7,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Reason three: physics needs both sizes.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 190.7,
     "end": 194.175,
     "dur": 3.475,
     "start_frame": 5721,
     "end_frame": 5825
    },
    {
     "text": "Pull a sled with twenty newtons, at sixty degrees, for five metres.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 194.525,
     "end": 199.625,
     "dur": 5.1,
     "start_frame": 5836,
     "end_frame": 5989
    },
    {
     "text": "The force's shadow, ten newtons, is still a force.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 199.975,
     "end": 203.7,
     "dur": 3.725,
     "start_frame": 5999,
     "end_frame": 6111
    },
    {
     "text": "Times five metres: fifty joules of work; twice as far, double the work.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 204.05,
     "end": 209.175,
     "dur": 5.125,
     "start_frame": 6121,
     "end_frame": 6275
    }
   ],
   "end": 209.975,
   "start_frame": 5721,
   "end_frame": 6299
  },
  {
   "id": "s13_vallis17",
   "start": 209.975,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Now the weather.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 209.975,
     "end": 211.625,
     "dur": 1.65,
     "start_frame": 6299,
     "end_frame": 6349
    },
    {
     "text": "This is Vallis one point seven.",
     "audio_text": "This is Valiss one point seven.",
     "start": 211.975,
     "end": 214.725,
     "dur": 2.75,
     "start_frame": 6359,
     "end_frame": 6442
    },
    {
     "text": "Phi is anything the air carries; here, temperature T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 215.075,
     "end": 219.225,
     "dur": 4.15,
     "start_frame": 6452,
     "end_frame": 6577
    },
    {
     "text": "Vallis calls the wind v.",
     "audio_text": "Valiss calls the wind v.",
     "start": 219.575,
     "end": 221.825,
     "dur": 2.25,
     "start_frame": 6587,
     "end_frame": 6655
    }
   ],
   "end": 222.625,
   "start_frame": 6299,
   "end_frame": 6679
  },
  {
   "id": "s14_two_thermometers",
   "start": 222.625,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Picture two thermometers.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 222.625,
     "end": 224.825,
     "dur": 2.2,
     "start_frame": 6679,
     "end_frame": 6745
    },
    {
     "text": "One is fixed on a pole: partial T by partial t is how fast it changes.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 225.175,
     "end": 230.75,
     "dur": 5.575,
     "start_frame": 6755,
     "end_frame": 6922
    },
    {
     "text": "One rides a balloon with the air: D T by D t, the material derivative.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 231.1,
     "end": 237.0,
     "dur": 5.9,
     "start_frame": 6933,
     "end_frame": 7110
    },
    {
     "text": "The last term, v dot grad T, is the extra change from moving through the temperature map.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 237.35,
     "end": 243.75,
     "dur": 6.4,
     "start_frame": 7120,
     "end_frame": 7312
    },
    {
     "text": "Balloon's change equals pole's change, plus the change from crossing the slope, called advection: carrying by the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 244.1,
     "end": 252.225,
     "dur": 8.125,
     "start_frame": 7323,
     "end_frame": 7567
    }
   ],
   "end": 253.025,
   "start_frame": 6679,
   "end_frame": 7591
  },
  {
   "id": "s15_grad_t",
   "start": 253.025,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Grad T is an arrow of two slopes: how fast T changes per metre east, and per metre north.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 253.025,
     "end": 259.75,
     "dur": 6.725,
     "start_frame": 7591,
     "end_frame": 7792
    },
    {
     "text": "It points uphill, towards warmer air; its length is the steepness.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 260.1,
     "end": 264.7,
     "dur": 4.6,
     "start_frame": 7803,
     "end_frame": 7941
    },
    {
     "text": "Here, one degree per hundred kilometres east: ten to the minus five kelvin per metre.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 265.05,
     "end": 271.35,
     "dur": 6.3,
     "start_frame": 7951,
     "end_frame": 8140
    }
   ],
   "end": 272.15,
   "start_frame": 7591,
   "end_frame": 8164
  },
  {
   "id": "s16_calculation",
   "start": 272.15,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The wind is ten metres per second, sixty degrees from grad T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 272.15,
     "end": 277.025,
     "dur": 4.875,
     "start_frame": 8164,
     "end_frame": 8311
    },
    {
     "text": "Its shadow: five metres per second.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 277.375,
     "end": 280.475,
     "dur": 3.1,
     "start_frame": 8321,
     "end_frame": 8414
    },
    {
     "text": "Times the steepness: five times ten to the minus five kelvin per second, point one eight kelvin per hour.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 280.825,
     "end": 288.075,
     "dur": 7.25,
     "start_frame": 8425,
     "end_frame": 8642
    }
   ],
   "end": 288.875,
   "start_frame": 8164,
   "end_frame": 8666
  },
  {
   "id": "s17_rate_in_time",
   "start": 288.875,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Does the map warm by point one eight an hour?",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 288.875,
     "end": 291.925,
     "dur": 3.05,
     "start_frame": 8666,
     "end_frame": 8758
    },
    {
     "text": "No, the map stays put; its slope is a rate in space.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 292.275,
     "end": 296.525,
     "dur": 4.25,
     "start_frame": 8768,
     "end_frame": 8896
    },
    {
     "text": "The air heads towards warmth at eighteen kilometres an hour.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 296.875,
     "end": 300.85,
     "dur": 3.975,
     "start_frame": 8906,
     "end_frame": 9026
    },
    {
     "text": "Each hour, it reaches places point one eight degrees warmer.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 301.2,
     "end": 305.575,
     "dur": 4.375,
     "start_frame": 9036,
     "end_frame": 9167
    }
   ],
   "end": 306.375,
   "start_frame": 8666,
   "end_frame": 9191
  },
  {
   "id": "s18_label_zero",
   "start": 306.375,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Suppose each parcel keeps its temperature: no sunshine, no mixing.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 306.375,
     "end": 311.25,
     "dur": 4.875,
     "start_frame": 9191,
     "end_frame": 9338
    },
    {
     "text": "It carries it like a label, so D T by D t is zero.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 311.6,
     "end": 315.8,
     "dur": 4.2,
     "start_frame": 9348,
     "end_frame": 9474
    },
    {
     "text": "Put zero in, then subtract v dot grad T from both sides: partial T by partial t equals minus v dot grad T.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 316.15,
     "end": 325.3,
     "dur": 9.15,
     "start_frame": 9485,
     "end_frame": 9759
    }
   ],
   "end": 326.1,
   "start_frame": 9191,
   "end_frame": 9783
  },
  {
   "id": "s19_pole_cools",
   "start": 326.1,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "So the thermometer on the pole falls point one eight degrees an hour, over four a day.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 326.1,
     "end": 331.75,
     "dur": 5.65,
     "start_frame": 9783,
     "end_frame": 9953
    },
    {
     "text": "The arriving air comes from colder places upwind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 332.1,
     "end": 335.775,
     "dur": 3.675,
     "start_frame": 9963,
     "end_frame": 10073
    }
   ],
   "end": 336.575,
   "start_frame": 9783,
   "end_frame": 10097
  },
  {
   "id": "s20_twice_as_steep",
   "start": 336.575,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Make the map twice as steep.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 336.575,
     "end": 338.925,
     "dur": 2.35,
     "start_frame": 10097,
     "end_frame": 10168
    },
    {
     "text": "The wind's shadow stays five metres per second: it belongs to the wind.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 339.275,
     "end": 344.575,
     "dur": 5.3,
     "start_frame": 10178,
     "end_frame": 10337
    },
    {
     "text": "But the pole cools twice as fast, point three six degrees an hour: the dot product holds the steepness, and the shadow alone doesn't.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 344.925,
     "end": 353.975,
     "dur": 9.05,
     "start_frame": 10348,
     "end_frame": 10619
    }
   ],
   "end": 354.775,
   "start_frame": 10097,
   "end_frame": 10643
  },
  {
   "id": "s21_recap_end",
   "start": 354.775,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Three reasons, then: it's the same both ways, it's cheap, and physics needs both sizes.",
     "audio_text": null,
     "start": 354.775,
     "end": 360.775,
     "dur": 6.0,
     "start_frame": 10643,
     "end_frame": 10823
